<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1301574789"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6801207119"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Find the way"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="舞花 / Vivienne"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Darkness Brightness"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:52.439"><div begin="00:00.360" end="03:48.528"><p begin="00:00.360" end="00:04.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Even if I fall again, I'll rise because of you</p><p begin="00:04.365" end="00:07.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定会找到前进的路</span></p><p begin="00:07.765" end="00:10.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way</p><p begin="00:10.944" end="00:14.924" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">All across the constellations I will find the way</p><p begin="00:16.571" end="00:17.038" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Move!</p><p begin="00:17.179" end="00:17.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Don't stop!</p><p begin="00:18.069" end="00:19.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Reach out for the light!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（所以此刻，尽情高飞吧…）</span></p><p begin="00:19.951" end="00:20.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Move!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就起飞吧</span></p><p begin="00:20.591" end="00:21.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Don't stop!</p><p begin="00:21.442" end="00:23.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Gotta keep on moving til I die!</p><p begin="00:23.961" end="00:24.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Don't stop!</p><p begin="00:24.821" end="00:26.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Reach out for the light!</p><p begin="00:26.802" end="00:27.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Move!</p><p begin="00:27.442" end="00:27.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Don't stop!</p><p begin="00:30.457" end="00:32.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">When did I lose my way?</p><p begin="00:32.169" end="00:33.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">When did I start to fade?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朦胧的深夜里</span></p><p begin="00:33.914" end="00:35.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I can't escape the pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独自一人不断彷徨</span></p><p begin="00:35.240" end="00:37.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Inside of me, inside of me</p><p begin="00:37.352" end="00:38.864" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">When did I slip away?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫无目的 不知该去往何方</span></p><p begin="00:39.023" end="00:40.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">When did I fade away?</p><p begin="00:40.767" end="00:43.671" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">I can't escape the pain inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为确认那不断回响的声音</span></p><p begin="00:43.990" end="00:45.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Then you show me light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能感受到</span></p><p begin="00:45.484" end="00:46.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">My eyes are open wide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心在指引你走向辉煌吗</span></p><p begin="00:47.397" end="00:48.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I can see the stars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心在等待你的决定</span></p><p begin="00:48.463" end="00:50.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">That guide me all the way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续行进，迈向那天</span></p><p begin="00:50.828" end="00:52.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I've been feeling weak<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">义无反顾 勇往直前</span></p><p begin="00:52.306" end="00:53.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">So broken and so bleak<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要回头</span></p><p begin="00:53.797" end="00:55.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I know I am still holding on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似停歇的大雨那头</span></p><p begin="00:55.780" end="00:58.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Until the first break of dawn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挥洒而下的阳光一般</span></p><p begin="00:58.780" end="01:02.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Even if I fall again, I'll rise because of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 坚持下去</span></p><p begin="01:02.645" end="01:05.958" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐梦想</span></p><p begin="01:06.030" end="01:09.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就出发吧</span></p><p begin="01:09.212" end="01:12.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">All across the constellations I will find the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">找寻前路吧 走向光芒照耀之处</span></p><p begin="01:13.093" end="01:16.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">If I fade away, I'll shine because of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走向越过所有黑夜的那头</span></p><p begin="01:16.348" end="01:19.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you</p><p begin="01:19.739" end="01:22.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛放出璀璨星光 照亮黑暗</span></p><p begin="01:22.983" end="01:26.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">All across the constellations I will find the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让在空中回响的声音 不断延续</span></p><p begin="01:26.874" end="01:27.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Move!</p><p begin="01:27.454" end="01:28.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">Don't stop!</p><p begin="01:28.308" end="01:29.949" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Reach out for the light!</p><p begin="01:30.228" end="01:30.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Move!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个晚上 我不知道未来在哪里</span></p><p begin="01:30.900" end="01:31.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Don't stop!</p><p begin="01:31.713" end="01:34.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Gotta keep on moving til I die!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因动弹不得 我不停哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:34.292" end="01:34.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Don't stop!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知该何去何从 眼泪从眼角滑落</span></p><p begin="01:35.141" end="01:36.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">Reach out for the light!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗似乎在召唤我</span></p><p begin="01:37.121" end="01:37.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">Move!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自己不禁在幽雾中止步</span></p><p begin="01:37.739" end="01:38.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">Don't stop!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在重重迷雾之中 我不禁停下脚步</span></p><p begin="01:40.709" end="01:42.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">When did I close my eyes?</p><p begin="01:42.430" end="01:44.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">When did I go so blind?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依稀摇曳的希望</span></p><p begin="01:44.139" end="01:45.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">I can't escape the shame<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呼唤着你</span></p><p begin="01:45.476" end="01:47.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Inside of me, inside of me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">侧耳倾听</span></p><p begin="01:47.566" end="01:49.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">When did I fall behind?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为足迹沾染色彩 继续向前吧</span></p><p begin="01:49.288" end="01:51.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">When did I lose my mind?</p><p begin="01:51.016" end="01:53.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">I can't escape the shame inside<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风雨过后总有彩虹</span></p><p begin="01:54.280" end="01:55.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">Then you show me light<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要忘记 我们并不是孤军奋战</span></p><p begin="01:55.767" end="01:57.174" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">My eyes are open wide</p><p begin="01:57.652" end="02:00.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">I can see the stars that guide me all the way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一步一步来</span></p><p begin="02:01.060" end="02:02.546" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">I know I'll be strong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前行吧 张开双翼</span></p><p begin="02:02.637" end="02:04.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">When all the pain is gone</p><p begin="02:04.145" end="02:06.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">I know I am still holding on</p><p begin="02:06.055" end="02:08.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Until the first break of dawn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飞吧</span></p><p begin="02:09.033" end="02:12.789" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">Even if I fall again, I'll rise because of you</p><p begin="02:12.935" end="02:16.238" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you</p><p begin="02:16.323" end="02:19.453" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮天空</span></p><p begin="02:19.547" end="02:23.187" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">All across the constellations I will find the way</p><p begin="02:23.373" end="02:26.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">If I fade away, I'll shine because of you</p><p begin="02:26.660" end="02:29.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">余音空设阻碍 将冰冷的道路完全堵住</span></p><p begin="02:29.950" end="02:33.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堵塞冰冷的前路</span></p><p begin="02:33.240" end="02:37.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">All across the constellations I will find the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像是心抽离我的身体 渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="02:53.539" end="02:57.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">Even if I fall again, I'll rise because of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走向越过所有黑夜的那头</span></p><p begin="02:57.481" end="03:00.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you</p><p begin="03:00.881" end="03:04.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">盛放出璀璨星光 照亮黑暗</span></p><p begin="03:04.129" end="03:08.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">All across the constellations I will find the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让在空中回响的声音 不断延续</span></p><p begin="03:09.060" end="03:12.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">Even if I fall again, I'll rise because of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（尽情高飞…）</span></p><p begin="03:12.909" end="03:16.233" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you</p><p begin="03:16.329" end="03:19.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论是怎样的时光 都要永远向前飞奔</span></p><p begin="03:19.545" end="03:23.098" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">All across the constellations I will find the way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（点亮天空…）</span></p><p begin="03:23.379" end="03:26.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">If I fade away, I'll shine because of you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点亮天空 挣脱迷茫</span></p><p begin="03:26.559" end="03:29.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">And even if I'm lost again, I'll find my way to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握编织出我们的星屑吧</span></p><p begin="03:29.969" end="03:33.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">Move past the dying stars, all through the Milky Way</p><p begin="03:33.299" end="03:37.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L81">All across the constellations I will find the way</p><p begin="03:37.112" end="03:37.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L82">Move!</p><p begin="03:37.775" end="03:38.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L83">Don't stop!</p><p begin="03:38.562" end="03:40.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L84">Reach out for the light!</p><p begin="03:40.507" end="03:41.058" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L85">Move!</p><p begin="03:41.164" end="03:41.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L86">Don't stop!</p><p begin="03:42.002" end="03:44.456" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L87">Gotta keep on moving til I die!</p><p begin="03:44.552" end="03:45.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L88">Don't stop!</p><p begin="03:45.427" end="03:46.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L89">Reach out for the light!</p><p begin="03:47.389" end="03:47.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L90">Move!</p><p begin="03:48.009" end="03:48.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L91">Don't stop!</p></div></body></tt>